+        "{type:'automorphism', scale:u, shear:w, generator_images:{sigma:[u,0]," 
+        "tau:[w,1]}}.  Here u is one of the (p-1)/2 nonzero quadratic "
+        "residues modulo p and 0 <= w < p; the generator-image fields are "
